Chapter: Console

 The Console effect declares two operations for text input and output.

 To print-line-uni gives Nothing under the Console.Write effect, writing one line to the output stream.
 To read-line gives Text under the Console.Read effect, reading one line from the input stream.

 We say:

Section: Definitions

  effect Console where
    print-line-uni : Text -> [Console.Write] Nothing
    read-line  : [Console.Read] Text

